# The URL of the websocket defined in web_socket.py
# If you're using the same slurm node as someone else, pick a different port.

# Available Ports:
# - Ryu:     2000-3000
# - Zengief: 3001-3100
# - Terry:   3101-3200

# This should match WEB_SOCKET_PORT in actint-backend/.env.
# Use 127.0.0.1 (localhost) only when the client and backend 
# are both running on the same machine.
# If the client is on a different machine, use the backend machine's network IP address
# so the client can receive WebSocket messages correctly.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEBSOCKET_URL=ws://129.123.61.22:3050